{
  "$schema": "../meta/catalog.schema.json",
  "id": "cat54",
  "sunatCatalog": "54",
  "name": "Bienes y Servicios sujetos a Detracción (SPOT)",
  "source": "Códigos from the 'Catálogos' sheet of perunio-facturador/resources/reglas/reglas-validacion-cpe-2026-08-26.xlsx (catálogo 54, which is Anexo 4 of R.S. 183-2004/SUNAT). The workbook publishes no rates, so props.porcentaje and props.umbral come from the SPOT itself: R.S. 183-2004/SUNAT and its modifications, as SUNAT's orientación pages state them (orientacion.sunat.gob.pe › Detracciones › '02. En la venta de bienes' and '03. En la prestación de servicios', read 2026-10-15). Corrected in v1.2.0: 012, 020, 022 and 037 (Anexo 3 numerales 1, 3, 5 and 10) are 12%, not 10% — R.S. 071-2018/SUNAT raised them from 2018-04-01, and the 10% was the 2015 rate, copied from the SFS anexo that v1.1.0 was checked against (AnexosIyII_Formato1.3.4.xlsx, perunio-facturador commit b00a315). R.S. 000086-2025/SUNAT added 044 (servicio de beneficio de minerales metálicos, Anexo 3 numeral 11, 12%) and 045 (minerales de oro y sus concentrados, Anexo 1 numeral 3, 10%) from 2025-04-01 and moved 034 to Anexo 1. 011 and 016 have been Anexo 2 numerales 7 and 11 at 10% since R.S. 082-2018/SUNAT; 032 (numeral 17) is 10% and 041 (numeral 23) 15%. 004's 4% applies only when the proveedor appears in SUNAT's 'Listado de proveedores sujetos al SPOT con el porcentaje de 4%'; otherwise it is 10%. props.umbral is the importe de la operación above which the detracción applies: S/700 for Anexos 2 and 3, except Anexo 2 numerales 6, 16 and 21 (010, 031, 036), which apply at any amount (0) — SUNAT's text also excepts numeral 19, which R.S. 000086-2025/SUNAT moved to Anexo 1 as 034; half a UIT for Anexo 1 (001, 003, 034, 045 — R.S. 183-2004 article 2.1), which is 2750 for 2026 (UIT S/5,500, D.S. 301-2025-EF) and must be revised every January; S/400 for transporte de carga (027); and none for the primera venta de inmuebles (040). Article 2.1 also subjects a smaller Anexo 1 operación when one transport unit carries more than half a UIT of such bienes, and the proveedor then deposits (article 5.1 b.1); the issuance form asks it, since only the user knows the transport unit. Whether the umbral of a venta con anticipos is measured against the whole operación or against each comprobante is not settled by any SUNAT source; Perunio measures the operación, its own conservative reading, decided without a source (perunio-facturador/DETRACCIONES.md › Cuándo aplica). That logic stays in resolveDetraccion; only the numbers live here. props.porcentaje is null where no SPOT rate applies here: 002 (arroz, under the IVAP's own regime), 013 and 015 (no longer in Anexo 2), 028 (transporte público de pasajeros, its own regime) and 099 (Ley 30737). Those carry no `emit` or `select`, because offering a detracción without knowing its rate would guess at money withheld from a supplier. Fill the rate and add the capabilities together. props.operationType is the Cat.51 código the operación must declare. SUNAT's fault 3129 checks one direction only: under 1002, 1003 or 1004 the código must be 004, 028 or 027; a pinned código under 1001 is not a 3129, but Perunio pins both directions. The workbook also lists 038, 042, 043, 046 and 047 (espectáculos públicos, ladrillos, estructuras metálicas, cobre and plata), but its Control de Cambios strikes through the row that added them and SUNAT's current anexos do not include them, so they are not carried. props.anexo (v1.3.0) is where the código sits in R.S. 183-2004/SUNAT: '1', '2' or '3' for its Anexos 1–3; 'carga' for transporte de bienes por vía terrestre (R.S. 073-2006/SUNAT); 'inmueble' for the venta de inmuebles gravada (R.S. 022-2013/SUNAT); 'especial' for the códigos with a regime of their own (002 IVAP arroz, R.S. 266-2004/SUNAT; 028 transporte público de pasajeros, R.S. 057-2007/SUNAT; 099 Ley 30737); null for 013 and 015, which no anexo carries any more. It drives the comprobante exclusion: a comprobante that grants no crédito fiscal (a boleta) excludes Anexos 2 and 3 (articles 8 and 13) and transporte de carga (R.S. 073-2006 article 3), never Anexo 1 (article 3) or the inmueble regime. A no-domiciliado usuario excludes Anexo 3 (article 13) and transporte de carga (R.S. 073-2006 article 3). props.porcentajeAlternativo is the rate when the conditional one does not hold: 004 is 10% unless the proveedor is on SUNAT's 4% listado. v1.3.1 dropped 004's `select` while the facturador refused it; v1.4.1 restores it, now that the facturador emits the six Cat.55 concepts (3001–3006) that operation type 1002 requires on every line.",
  "codePattern": "^[0-9]{3}$",
